   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Basic education and geneder equality - The goal of the contribution is to develop and implement early childhood education, increase enrollment in primary education, better equal gender balance in selected woredas, improve the quality of education to children in conflict areas and internal displaced children can be allowed to continue their education</narrative>
